#EXTM3U x-tvg-url="https://iptv-org.github.io/epg/guides/ro.xml"
# ^ THE HEADER. Must be the very first line, exactly "#EXTM3U".
#   x-tvg-url is optional: it tells a player where to find the XMLTV
#   programme guide for these channels. Multiple guides = comma separated.
#
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# ANATOMY OF ONE CHANNEL  —  it is ALWAYS exactly two lines.
#
#   Line 1:  #EXTINF:<duration> <attributes>,<Display Name>
#   Line 2:  the stream URL, bare, nothing else on the line
#
#   duration   = -1 for live TV (it never ends). A number of seconds for VOD.
#   attributes = space separated key="value" pairs. All optional.
#
#   THE COMMA TRAP — the single thing most parsers get wrong.
#   The name is everything after the first comma that is NOT inside quotes.
#     - Split on the first comma blindly and  group-title="Sports, Live"
#       cuts the line in half.
#     - Split on the LAST comma instead and a channel genuinely called
#       "Sport, Live HD" gets truncated to "Live HD".
#   So you must walk the line character by character, flipping an
#   "inside quotes" flag on every " and splitting at the first comma
#   found while outside quotes. That is what the app's parser does.
#
#   Useful attributes:
#     tvg-id      matches this channel to the EPG guide. Must match exactly.
#     tvg-name    name as written in the EPG, if different from display name
#     tvg-logo    URL to a logo image, ideally transparent PNG
#     group-title the folder/category your app shows in its sidebar
#     tvg-shift   hours to shift the EPG, e.g. "-1" for a timezone offset
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Romania -----------------------------------------------------------
#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="AlephNews.ro" tvg-logo="https://i.imgur.com/qPRQZMI.png" group-title="News",Aleph News
https://stream-aleph.m.ro/Aleph/ngrp:Alephnewsmain.stream_all/playlist.m3u8

#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="A7TV.ro" tvg-logo="https://i.imgur.com/RmFg8BN.png" group-title="General",A7TV
https://a7tvlive.ro/A7TV/A7TV/playlist.m3u8

#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="AgroTV.ro" tvg-logo="https://i.imgur.com/S7X1PiC.png" group-title="Outdoor",Agro TV
https://agrotv.streamnet.ro/mobile_tv/agrotv.m3u8

